<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.10 percent on Wednesday from 6.82 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said seven banks traded on the market in 14 reported transactions with a total value of 18.86 million dinars.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
